f2fb55.webm?t=1752673903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838270/extras/a5c8b40b46c96139a7dc2e5541f2fb55.mp4?t=1752673903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mana points support your abilities, sprint, jumping, combat mechanics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The reload is set to unlimited according to time.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Pass</strong> - Enemies will become more aggressive and stronger with each level passed</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The obstacles will become more difficult, so the most important structure will be to proceed carefully.</p>",
